  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "A forest plot of sensitivity (%) in six head-to-head studies grouped by test, with random-effects pooled estimates: TST 81.61% (72.34–88.27), IGRA (QFT) 77.04% (66.36–85.10) and TBST 78.10% (70.61–84.11). The test for subgroup differences is not significant (p = 0.74).",
      "lang": "en",
      "state": "draft",
